    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The first graduation ceremony of Aga Khan University (AKU) in Kenya was held on Monday 6 December at the Aga Khan Pavilion in Nairobi. Forty one (41) candidates received the Kenya Registered Community Health Nursing (KRCHN) Diploma, whilst five (5) candidates were awarded the Specialist Diploma in Accident, Emergency and Disaster Management.",
